# SkillForge Docker build-context boundary
# Keeps the build context lean: backend source + skills/ + knowledge/ + web/ only.
# Plan 07-01 / D7-04 (source-build images). Anything sensitive or non-runtime goes here.

# --- Planning / workflow / VCS artifacts (never in the image) ---
.planning/
.git/
.gitignore
.claude/

# --- Local runtime data / secrets ---
.env
.env.local
skillforge.db
skillforge.db-shm
skillforge.db-wal

# --- Build artifacts (host-built; the image builds its own) ---
*.exe
eval.exe
spike-*trace.json
web/dist/
web/node_modules/
node_modules/

# --- README assets (not a runtime dependency) ---
docs/demo*.gif

# --- Docker / compose definitions (avoid recursive context surprises) ---
Dockerfile
Dockerfile.*
docker-compose.yml
docker-compose.*.yml

# --- OS noise ---
.DS_Store
